abstract: >-
  Code, data, figures, and checked manuscript sources for a passive
  pseudo-Hermitian driven Dirac impurity. Version 2 adds causal spectral and
  Wigner-Smith checks, a controlled finite-U Anderson contact/Yang-Baxter
  reduction, and an operator-resolved biorthogonal NRG residue audit. The
  exact integrability claim is restricted to the linearized equal-velocity
  scalar-hybridization submanifold.
keywords:
  - non-Hermitian physics
  - exceptional points
  - quantum impurity
  - Dirac bath
  - causal spectral density
  - Wigner-Smith delay
  - numerical renormalization group
  - Yang-Baxter equation
